    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Think about sudoku, but reinvented!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has just a few simple rules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to fill a 4x5 grid with numbers from 1 to 5, ensuring that each row and column won't have duplicates and that the sum of each row\u2019s numbers gives the result on their right side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you must insert all five numbers (1,2,3,4,5) into the two colored sections on the grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle has a unique solution. It's relaxing, but still pretty challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to spice up the challenge, play \u2022 zenku \u2022 in YinYang mode and complete the puzzles within 2 minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you complete all 100 zenku puzzles?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frank Eno (aka XSGames) is an indie puzzle game dev from Italy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow @xsgames_ on both X and Instagram</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Think about sudoku, but reinvented!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has just a few simple rules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to fill a 4x5 grid with numbers from 1 to 5, ensuring that each row and column won't have duplicates and that the sum of each row\u2019s numbers gives the result on their right side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you must insert all five numbers (1,2,3,4,5) into the two colored sections on the grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle has a unique solution. It's relaxing, but still pretty challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to spice up the challenge, play \u2022 zenku \u2022 in YinYang mode and complete the puzzles within 2 minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you complete all 100 zenku puzzles?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frank Eno (aka XSGames) is an indie puzzle game dev from Italy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow @xsgames_ on both X and Instagram</p>",
